EMC track following example, based on "GeaneEx" tutorial from the Pavia group

To run the example

1) Make a softlink in the pandaroot directory (VMCWORKDIR)

> cd $VMCWORKDIR
> ln -s tutorials/geane/GeaneExEmc/src/ ./GeaneExEmc

2) Add in $VMCWORKDIR/CMakeLists.txt file the following lines

add_subdirectory (geane)
add_subdirectory (GeaneExEmc)

3) Build the libs

> cd <your build directory of pandaroot>
> cmake $VMCWORKDIR
> make install

4) Run the macros (1000 e- events with 2.0 GeV/c momentum)

> cd $VMCWORKDIR/tutorials/geane/GeaneExEmc/macro
> root -l -b -q "runMC.C(1000,2.0,\"e-\")"
> root -l -b -q runGEANE.C
> root -l runPULL.C

JGM, 28/03/2008